    <briefdescription>
<para>A hyperbolic tangent activation layer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classmattTorch_1_1Tanh" kindref="compound">Tanh</ref> class implements the tanh activation function as a network layer, applying the elementwise transformation:   <formula id="94">\[    f(x) = \tanh(x) = \frac{e^x - e^{-x}}{e^x + e^{-x}}
\]</formula> to the input tensor during the forward pass by delegating to <ref refid="classmattTorch_1_1TensorView_1a1e687142d7026837d7b4d04665874f75" kindref="member">TensorView::tanh()</ref>. This layer contains no learnable parameters.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classmattTorch_1_1Layer" kindref="compound">Layer</ref> for the base class from which this class derives. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classmattTorch_1_1TensorView_1a1e687142d7026837d7b4d04665874f75" kindref="member">TensorView::tanh()</ref> for the underlying tensor operation that performs the elementwise tanh computation and constructs the computational graph node. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
